Summary::md.summary
  More intuitive selection

  If you click on something, that shouldn’t initiate a drag, it should instead initiate a move.
Updated Jan 17, 2022, 02:29AM::md.update
  You need to have some way to force selection mode though, as otherwise a map that is completely covered becomes impossible to do specific multi selections.

  <hr>

  Also, you might want things like non-contiguous selections with things like shift-click. Idk if that actually will matter.

Resolved Jan 19, 2022, 06:15PM::md.update
  Shift-click was already taken for pings. You can hold alt/option to force rectangle select mode.

  <hr>

  You no longer need to do two clicks to both select and move something.
